WEBVTT

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:24.040
Gosh, it's hot!

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.870
Yeah, summer's in full swing.

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:28.860
By the way, Desumi-san.

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:31.360
There's a lot to do in the summer, isn't there?

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:33.130
Is there anything you'd 
like to do as a couple?

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:35.680
What a great idea, Fudo!

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:39.590
Let's see... what would be best?

00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:42.890
Barbecues, fireworks displays...

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:44.940
Let's see...

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:46.190
A trip to the mountains would be nice,

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:47.650
but I think it <i>has</i> to be the beach!

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:48.730
The beach?!

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:53.280
Fudo?

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:56.150
<i>Swimsuits?!</i>

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:58.570
Hey! Fudo?

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.480
<b><i>Opening Theme 

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:34.500
Episode 6    As Long as We're at the Beach...

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:39.260
<b><i>Tense</i></b>

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:39.780
Aha!

