<b><i>Tense</i></b>

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:45.760
<b><i>Tense</i></b>

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:52.400
What could be the poor recipient 
of the fire in her gaze?

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:53.690
<b>Green Tea Pudding</b>

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:53.690
<b>Tiramisu</b>

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:55.320
<b>Pasta Set
 Dessert Options</b>

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:55.320
<b>Hmmm...</b>

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:55.320
<b>Green Tea Pudding</b>

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:55.320
<b>Tiramisu</b>

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:55.320
You let me down, big-time!

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:57.920
Don't you know you've got 
an image to maintain?

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:02.120
You were the one person around here 
with a ferocity I could respect.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:06.970
Now look at you, eating pasta with 
that goofy look on your face!

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:09.710
Why'd you want to join 
Gekko in the first place?

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:11.850
I didn't. My family applied for me.

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:13.830
What are you, an idol?!

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:17.960
But that entrance exam ain't easy. 
How the hell'd you pass, then?

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:23.550
I just did my best,

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:25.530
and they put me in a leadership role.

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:31.060
<i>She never meant to apply? Is that 
why she doesn't take it seriously?</i>

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:33.580
Hey, Beast!

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:36.970
Don't you think a beach would be 
a great place for our next attack?

00:03:36.970 --> 00:03:37.650
Huh?!

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:44.410
<i>All squad leaders and Princess Series members,
report to the conference room at once.</i>

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:45.800
<i>I repeat.</i>

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:47.620
They don't usually call 
us in at this time of day.

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:49.870
<i>All squad leaders and Princess Series members,
 report to the conference room at once.</i>

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:55.630
Hey!

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:59.190
Drop the pasta and get moving!

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:04.890
Beast Princess and Reaper Princess,
 now in attendance!

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:11.890
<b>Allow me to explain!</b>

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:11.890
<i>Allow me to explain!</i>

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:16.990
<i>Secret Society Gekko is an 
uncompromising hierarchy!</i>

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:24.920
<b>Supreme Leader Bosslar</b>

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:24.920
<b>Monsters (Leaders)</b>

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:24.920
<b>Bear Monster</b>

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:24.920
<b>Snake Monster</b>

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:24.920
<b>Wolf Monster</b>

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:24.920
<b>Eagle Monster</b>

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:24.920
<b>Lion Monster</b>

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:24.920
<b>Rabbit Monster</b>

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:24.920
<b>Princess Series (Sub-Leaders)</b>

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:24.920
<b>Reaper</b>

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:24.920
<b>Steel</b>

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:24.920
<b>Blood</b>

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:24.920
<b>Heat</b>

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:24.920
<b>Beast</b>

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:24.920
<b>Judgment</b>

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:24.920
<b>Moonlight Soldiers</b>

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:21.330
<i>Its six squadrons are led by 
their six strongest monsters,</i>

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:24.920
<i>with the Princess Series serving 
below them as sub-leaders!</i>

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:29.890
Allow me to reveal the reason 
I have called you all here today.

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:35.790
I have decided to create a new monster 
and establish a new squadron!

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:41.070
Reaper Princess, step forward!

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:46.930
Congratulations!

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:51.050
Reaper Princess, Desumi Magahara!

00:04:52.010 --> 00:04:52.880
I am promoting you

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:57.440
from Princess Series to monster!

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:00.180
You'll undergo enhancement surgery,

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:01.840
be fused with an animal,

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:04.190
and acquire greater power than ever before!

00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:06.720
You... You want to make me a monster?

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:08.950
Damn it! They passed me over for <i>her</i>?!

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:10.720
H-Hang on a min—

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:12.340
You're moving up in the world at last!

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:15.620
I always knew you had it in you!

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:18.080
Welcome to the monster world!

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:20.460
These bodies are awesome, girl!

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:24.480
It's frustrating, but I'm gonna catch up soon!

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:26.830
Just wait and see!

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:28.680
Congratulations, Reaper-chan!

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:31.330
You'll be just like us!

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:33.180
<i>Drone Rabbit-senpai?</i>

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:34.840
<i>She's so pretty...</i>

00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:38.790
<i>If I could become a cute monster 
like her, maybe it wouldn't be so bad.</i>

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:40.520
Reaper Princess!

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:46.070
<b>Fusion Concept Diagram</b>

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:45.000
I intend to fuse you with a mountain gorilla!

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:49.190
A fusion between the two ultimate primates!

00:05:49.190 --> 00:05:52.330
A true miracle of chemistry!

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.290
Wait a minute!

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:55.700
The enhancement surgery 
will take place tomorrow!

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:57.150
W-Wait...

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:57.150
That is all!

00:05:57.150 --> 00:05:58.110
Dismissed!

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:05.740
If I become a monster,

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:08.650
it'll mean big changes to life as I know it.

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:11.740
No beach date, either, probably.

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:16.930
But I can't exactly say no...

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:25.780
<b>Lifetime Soldier</b>

00:06:21.670 --> 00:06:23.160
<i>Hey, Desumi!</i>

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:24.550
<i>How ya doin'?</i>

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:25.780
Dad...

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:29.200
<i>Got a message from Bosslar-sama.</i>

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:31.620
<i>He's promotin' you, he said!</i>

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:34.490
<i>That's my perfect little girl!</i>

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:36.250
<i>One, two...</i>

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:38.620
<i>Congratulations, Sis!</i>

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:43.410
<i>Never thought we'd have a monster in our 
very own family... It's a dream come true!</i>

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:45.990
<i>Now, dear, don't cry...</i>

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:48.630
<i>I was a combatant all through to retirement,</i>

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:49.630
<i>so it's makin' me so happy...</i>

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:52.450
<i>Give it your best, Desumi!</i>

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:53.510
Mom...

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:55.930
The truth is... I'm not sure I want...

00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:58.590
<i>And after seeing' how hard you been workin',</i>

00:06:58.590 --> 00:07:01.290
<i>your sister's finally started 
comin' out of her shell.</i>

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:02.820
<i>Go on, dear.</i>

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:05.020
<i>Talk to your big sister.</i>

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:07.030
<i>Big Sis.</i>

00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:08.140
Urami...

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:11.440
<i>I'm gonna join Gekko when I graduate.</i>

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:14.660
<i>You better keep fightin', 
even after you're a monster.</i>

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:17.660
<i>You're my idol, Big Sis.</i>

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:21.940
I hear ya, Urami.

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:23.670
No worries.

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:25.660
<i>See ya, Desumi!</i>

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:27.810
<i>Take care of yourself!</i>

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:30.110
<i>See ya! Keep fightin', Big Sis!</i>

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:40.770
My Gekko teammates and my family 
are all so happy for me...

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:45.670
They'll all be really upset if I 
turn the promotion down, right?

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:53.330
I wonder what Fudo would say.

00:07:55.790 --> 00:07:57.480
H-Hey!

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.790
<b>Fudo</b>

00:07:58.310 --> 00:07:59.790
F-Fudo?!

00:08:00.470 --> 00:08:02.410
Wh-Whaddya want?!

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:04.550
<i>That adorable Hakata dialect!</i>

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:09.600
I was just thinking about you, 
and I realized I wanted to hear your voice.

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:12.110
Is something up?

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:13.550
Your greeting was a little 
bit different than usual.

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:15.040
<i>Your greeting was a little 
bit different than usual.</i>

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:20.450
Nah, I'm sure I heard wrong.

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:21.750
Don't worry about it.

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:25.860
<i>Give me one hour!</i>

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.700
<b>I'm here, Desumi-san</b>

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:45.500
Fudo?

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:57.660
I see.

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:59.620
They want to make you a monster.

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:02.160
Yeah, and combine me with a gorilla.

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:04.480
You'd be the world's cutest gorilla!

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:06.730
This is serious for me, okay?!

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:12.190
Hey, Fudo.

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:13.990
What do you think I should do?

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:15.760
It doesn't matter what I think.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.970
What do <i>you</i> want to do?

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:22.640
<i>What </i>I<i> want to do...</i>

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:26.710
<i>Now that I think about it, this whole time,</i>

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:30.970
<i>I never even thought about it.</i>

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.230
<b>Gekko Interview Site</b>

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:33.950
Desumi-san...

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:39.120
Your kindness toward everyone around you 
is one of the things I love best about you.

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:44.890
But you should turn a little bit of that 
kindness toward yourself every now and then.

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:49.290
Now, what do <i>you</i> want to do?

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:54.010
<i>That's right.</i>

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:57.180
<i>It is okay for me to choose, isn't it?</i>

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:00.660
<i>If I become a gorilla,</i>

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:04.210
<i>it's going to be harder to do my manicures, 
my cooking, my handicrafts...</i>

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:09.170
It would make it harder 
to see you, too, Fudo.

00:10:09.930 --> 00:10:11.920
I want to go back to the 
amusement park with you.

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:13.810
I want to have our afterschool date.

00:10:13.810 --> 00:10:16.880
And I wouldn't feel comfortable going 
to the beach in any body but this one.

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:20.180
I don't want to give up on any of that.

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:23.200
<i>Fudo...</i>

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:27.810
<i>Meeting you has made me want 
to do so many new things.</i>

00:10:28.680 --> 00:10:30.560
<i>If I was still the person I was before you,</i>

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:33.520
<i>I probably would have gone along with 
what everyone else wanted for me.</i>

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:35.780
<i>But...</i>

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:38.970
<i>I'm sorry, everyone.</i>

00:10:39.310 --> 00:10:41.750
<i>I can't become a gorilla yet!</i>

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:48.370
<i>I want to be able to keep 
leaning on Fudo like this.</i>

00:10:51.980 --> 00:10:54.240
Wh-What?!

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:57.300
What do you mean, you don't 
want to become a monster?!

00:10:57.550 --> 00:10:59.510
That's my decision.

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:00.860
I have no regrets.

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:02.800
Are you freakin' nuts, Reaper?!

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:05.140
This is your chance to acquire <i>true</i> power!

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:09.660
You reject your great leader's generous offer?!

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:10.270
Yes.

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:21.210
Magnificent!

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:23.620
You are truly a wonder, Reaper Princess!

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:24.120
Huh?

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:28.310
Your style is to fight only with 
your naturally-given gifts!

00:11:28.310 --> 00:11:31.370
Truly, you have the heart of a martial artist!

00:11:31.650 --> 00:11:36.130
You believe accepting the power of an animal 
would be admitting your own weakness!

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:38.380
<b><i>Burned</i></b>

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:41.240
All right! A round of applause 
for Reaper Princess!

00:11:41.240 --> 00:11:43.340
You all could learn a thing or two from her!

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:48.180
<b>I told them I didn't want to become a monster!!</b>

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:53.520
<b>Fudo</b>

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:50.980
<b>Thanks, Fudo</b>

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:53.520
<b>You followed your heart
 and turned them down!</b>

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:53.520
<b>You're amazing, Desumi-san!</b>

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:57.050
Hey, it's Reaper Princess!

00:11:57.050 --> 00:11:59.270
She must have gotten her enhancement surgery!

00:11:59.270 --> 00:12:03.060
So that's what she looks like after 
being combined with the gorilla?

00:12:03.060 --> 00:12:05.740
Yeah! She's more intimidating than ever!

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:10.970
Love After World Domination!

00:12:22.310 --> 00:12:24.840
Wow, the weather is great!

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:28.850
I'm all ready! Let's go!

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:31.120
One moment, Reaper Princess.

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:34.100
<b>Ack</b>

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:34.520
What are you doing with that beach stuff?

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:37.220
Just because we're at the beach 
doesn't mean it's a vacation.

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:39.480
Honestly.

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:42.550
Now, are you sure about 
that tip you received?

00:12:42.550 --> 00:12:43.400
Yes, sir!

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:44.740
Absolutely certain!

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:47.240
You mean it, Fudo?

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:48.110
Yeah.

00:12:48.110 --> 00:12:54.250
This Saturday, we'll be doing a test drive 
of King Gelato Robo at Shonan Beach.

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:56.480
<i>Allow me to explain!</i>

00:12:56.480 --> 00:13:03.500
<i>King Gelato Robo is a 12-piece combining
 robot designed to fight giant monsters!</i>

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:05.750
The beach...

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:06.890
Does that mean...

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:07.850
Yes!

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:09.890
It's our chance for a beach date at last!

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:12.640
That's great, Fudo!

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:15.020
<b>Sparkle</b>

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:15.430
I can't wait for Saturday!

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:22.150
Hello? Is this Bear-sama?

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:25.030
I've just gotten a secret 
tip about the heroes' activities.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:29.490
<b>Gekko Aquatic Combat Loadout
Reaper Princess
(Swimsuit Provided)</b>

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:29.490
But it appears the heroes 
have not yet arrived.

00:13:30.720 --> 00:13:33.500
Then you should make careful 
preparations for their arrival.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:38.360
Our mission is to investigate 
and demolish the heroes' robot.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:38.520
<b>Gekko Aquatic Combat Loadout
 Culverin Bear & Steel Princess
(Swimsuits Provided)</b>

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:41.170
It's important to act 
carefully and discreetly.

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:44.230
This is a combined mission 
between our three squadrons.

00:13:44.230 --> 00:13:47.540
Let's all work together, 
Reaper-san, Beast-sa—

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:53.430
Oh? Why are you hiding behind those rocks?

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:55.520
I a-ain't hidin'!

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:57.180
I just...

00:13:58.260 --> 00:13:59.730
Well...

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:05.740
<b>Majima</b>

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:03.000
Don't my outfit seem a little 
different from what you guys got?

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:05.740
<b>Gekko Aquatic Combat Loadout
Beast Princess
(Swimsuit Provided)</b>

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:04.120
Certainly not.

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:05.750
It looks wonderful on you.

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:06.730
Yes!

00:14:06.730 --> 00:14:08.510
Y-You think?

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:12.120
Hey, Steel.

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:13.080
Don't stand next to me.

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:13.870
Buzz off!

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:16.500
But why? We should work together!

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:18.000
Just get lost, damn it!

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:43.480
Retreat! Retreat!

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:46.810
Oh, sorry!

00:14:46.810 --> 00:14:49.140
I accidentally fired the missiles!

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:51.490
They didn't hit anybody.

00:14:51.710 --> 00:14:53.280
I don't... think.

00:14:53.630 --> 00:14:54.740
Probably.

00:14:55.630 --> 00:14:58.460
They anticipated our sabotage mission.

00:14:58.700 --> 00:15:00.560
A submarine...

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:02.960
Is that a part of their giant robot?

00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:07.960
It's so much nicer out here than in there!

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:11.990
Misaki-san, no beer!

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:13.010
Oh, chill out.

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:14.890
As long as we're at the beach...

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:15.940
No way!

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:17.790
We're not here to have fun!

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:18.860
Now, now.

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:21.020
None of that, Misaki-kun.

00:15:21.450 --> 00:15:24.090
That one's still warm.

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:27.230
<b>Ta-dah</b>

00:15:24.090 --> 00:15:26.260
You'll want to drink these.

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:27.230
Professor...

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:29.210
Now, now, Haru-kun.

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:30.490
I know we're doing a test drive,

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:33.990
but it's just for Gelato Submarine.

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:37.530
And this one just forms the robot's calf,

00:15:37.530 --> 00:15:39.450
so it's not exactly essential.

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:41.520
<i>Then why did you make it?!</i>

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:43.500
Red's coming here!

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:52.190
What's the plan, Reaper?

00:15:52.190 --> 00:15:54.140
You think we can handle 
the mission on our own?

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:55.680
