00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:14.030
Hey!

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:18.120
I was so taken aback by your 
loveliness that I forgot to breathe!

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:19.910
Cut it out! You scared me!

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:25.080
Don't stare at me like that!

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:28.770
I didn't choose the outfit myself, 
but it's a little embarrassing...

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:30.170
<b>Oh so precious</b>

00:16:28.770 --> 00:16:30.170
<i>Oh so precious!</i>

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:40.250
