There was something I wanted to try.

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:46.560
Okay! Let's do it!

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:50.490
<i>She intends to execute the 
plan completely on her own.</i>

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:52.890
<i>Reaper Princess is truly impressive.</i>

00:16:52.890 --> 00:16:55.820
<i>Meanwhile, I always get 
stuck evaluating risk...</i>

00:16:57.940 --> 00:17:00.660
<i>That's the difference between us.</i>

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:03.540
<i>But... that ends today!</i>

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:06.260
<i>I, Beast Princess, A.K.A. Kiki Majima,</i>

00:17:06.260 --> 00:17:08.190
